  "details": "(Reupload of existing canny as previous one got year old.)\n(Deplicate of https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/dynamic-bone-used-in-worlds-on-spawned-prefabs-is-now-broken)\nTested VRChat Version: 2020.2.1p1\nUnity Version: 2018.4.20.f1\nSDK Version: VRCSDK2-2020.05.12.10.37_Public\nDescription of Bug: If Spawned Prefab got Dynamic Bone, it does not work.\nStep to reproduce: Make prefab (which include dynamic bone on object) to assign to VRC_Trigger+SpawnObject.\nSample World: wrld_0d1fae89-d2fc-4201-9916-598b89dd0f55\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_0d1fae89-d2fc-4201-9916-598b89dd0f55\n*Both object placed on the world are same file. (Expect spawned object made as prefab of SetGameObjectActive)",
